		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Re: No 1750 Hz Toneburst]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2443&amp;p=20247#p20247"><![CDATA[
On the MDUV380 the 1750 Hz Toneburst is sent by pressing the green key while transmitting. <br><br>This is different to the GD77 which uses SK2. <br><br>This is due to the MDUV380 code originating from the MD9600 which doesn't have an SK2 key on the microphone.<br><br>I will see if this can be made the same as the GD77. <br><br>The key mapping is currently being re-written by Roger, The next version will swap the Up and Down Keys. <br><br>Colin G4EML<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Fri Oct 21, 2022 7:22 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
