		<title type="html"><![CDATA[No 1750 Hz Toneburst]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2443&amp;p=20245#p20245"><![CDATA[
I've been a long time user of the firmware on my DM-1801 and have just installed the latest Alpha on an new RT3S.<br><br>A quick observation is that I can't generate  a 1750 Hz toneburst on the RT-3S - this isn't a huge problem as this isn't used now as CTCSS access is common for analogue repeater access here in the UK. However I thought the development team may be interested.<br><br>As an aside I would welcome a change to the operation of the UP/DOWN keys so that pressing UP increases values and vice versa.<br><br>Many thanks for all your hard work.<br><br>James G1PVZ<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=1654">G1PVZ</a> — Fri Oct 21, 2022 6:55 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
